  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "CUFFS"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Question one. What is justice?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v04.wav",
   "d": 2.614,
   "e": "0000mzyetuswzytoxrzue4yxkhlxxngf70000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "TEX"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "Justice is… me leavin'.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v06.wav",
   "d": 2.2,
   "e": "0000hzzicymjszzrf0oxxuxwrqpjd10000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Incorrect. Penalty: clarification.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v07.wav",
   "d": 3.064,
   "e": "000ztxsxzv9j3pwxxqyjgwwtymtztpzplc000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "IMMORTAL"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "IMMORTAL",
   "text": "Premise required to fire.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v09.wav",
   "d": 2.925,
   "e": "000009zzyqif00vkizzrld00jliwqhd300000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "Premise: You're pointin' a gun at me. Conclusion: I don't like it.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v10.wav",
   "d": 4.2,
   "e": "00uwyqzdxywvswvsope05zlzyvvpuuswgna00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "IMMORTAL",
   "text": "Invalid form.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v11.wav",
   "d": 2.2,
   "e": "00000009xyxokzzzpoi600amwqjc300000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you can't argue with a man holding a gun",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/98d8929b-f22e-5a4d-87ec-f3f1eae84ca6/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/7cbf90dd-0629-5c81-a916-d675e98460ed.mp4",
   "in": 1.8,
   "d": 2.41,
   "said": "Yes, yes you can make that argument.",
   "src": "Architecture of Antitrust (Part 2)",
   "y": 1999
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Question three. Define \"the Good.\"",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v13.wav",
   "d": 2.764,
   "e": "0005wzskvpcpzzvjrs6xtvurxbwzzxhkb0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "The Good is… what keeps my family breathin'.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v14.wav",
   "d": 2.95,
   "e": "000phzzzxpfgyfcqilvwdtussktyhhjb00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Answer too particular. The Good must be universal.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v15.wav",
   "d": 3.864,
   "e": "00ozwsltwfuorrzvjhwswpztbqryuzunzs300000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "Universal, huh? Universal is: a man who steals folks' lives gets shot.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v16.wav",
   "d": 5.275,
   "e": "0dzytwrwivzyvuumc0yywuiys8zhvwjrlvm00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Threat detected. Penalty: re-education.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v17.wav",
   "d": 3.439,
   "e": "000gynbrjvhqze0juwrqtjvvzoxjzxnynl000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Final question. If a part cannot exist without the whole, is it unjust to destroy the whole?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v18.wav",
   "d": 6.014,
   "e": "02yvvuxu0yvvuuxuylztszqxxuqylunvwuzz5000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "Depends.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v19.wav",
   "d": 1.325,
   "e": "0000000bzj0guzzxvttspidea000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Define \"depends.\"",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v20.wav",
   "d": 2.114,
   "e": "00004owk6zvuzywsvzapvywytwtliid000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "TEX",
   "text": "Depends… on whether the whole's worth keepin'.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v21.wav",
   "d": 2.8,
   "e": "000tbuzywohxyzwvxjxxlnzq3dubrlh800000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "CUFFS",
   "text": "Acceptable. Initiating release sequence— for review.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep05/v22.wav",
   "d": 3.764,
   "e": "00qolxcuyzrzunvtrsvpvkpotukavzgwzn000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "well, it depends on the circumstances",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/d27c4328-f00b-5564-8fd8-19c602e4c980/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/5b0b00c7-12f9-57e0-95d1-57e9d34d2623.mp4",
   "in": 17.28,
   "d": 2.62,
   "said": "Usually it's an entirely different situation.",
   "src": "Coffee Break",
   "y": null
  },
  {
